  "fullDescription": "Add a festive centerpiece to your holiday table with this Christmas Tree Cake Stand 3D STL File. This elegant cake stand combines practical serving functionality with a charming Christmas tree-inspired decorative design, making it perfect for holiday celebrations, Christmas parties, dessert displays, and seasonal home decor.\n\nThe stand features a wide circular serving platform with a raised rim for helping keep cakes and desserts securely positioned. The outer edge is decorated with repeated raised Christmas tree motifs, creating a beautiful festive pattern around the entire stand. The sculpted pedestal base provides a stable and balanced foundation while adding an attractive decorative appearance.\n\nThe clean, rounded construction makes this design suitable for displaying cakes, cupcakes, pastries, cookies, pies, and other lightweight desserts. The model can be customized with different filament colors to match Christmas themes, party decorations, or personal kitchen decor.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nChristmas cake displays\nHoliday dessert tables\nChristmas party decorations\nFestive kitchen decor\nCake and cupcake displays\nChristmas centerpiece decor\nHoliday baking projects\nDessert presentation\nSeasonal tabletop decor\nChristmas entertaining\nDIY 3D printing projects\nHandmade kitchen accessories\nHoliday gift projects\nChristmas home decoration\n\nFile Type: STL\nProduct Type: Digital 3D printable file\nDesigned For: 3D printing\nSuitable For: FDM 3D Printers\nUse: Cake Stand, Dessert Display, Christmas Decor\nDelivery: Digital download only\nPhysical Product: No physical product will be shipped\n\nCreate a beautiful Christmas-themed cake and dessert display with this printable STL design, combining functional serving space with a festive tree-patterned decorative style.",
